<title>FRANCE: CIP sees 1996 net at 345 mln francs.</title>
<headline>CIP sees 1996 net at 345 mln francs.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Compagnie d'Investissements de Paris, part of Paribas, said it estimated its 1996 net consolidated profit at 345 million francs against 126.1 million last year.</p>
<p>It said its net value per share was estimated at 256.20 francs before latent tax liabilities.</p>
</text>
